      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I completely agree! There should be a feature to be able to drop a portal to Group+ instances which would allow anyone to enter the portal if they are a part of the group OR they have a friend in the Group\n\nDropping a portal to Group only instances should also be possible and ONLY people who are a part of the Group should be able to enter! \n\nThis would make collaborations much easier if you need to drop a portal to the next instance that would be Group+ or Group only\n\nWe shouldn't HAVE to make a Group Public instance (which increases the risk of video player sabotage, trolls entering the instance, children entering the instance, etc) just so we can have portals dropped to that instance",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
